	(text "FIRMWARE PIN MAP (ESP32-S3 SuperMini)\nOLED I2C (SH1107 128x128, addr 0x3C): SDA = GPIO11, SCL = GPIO12, powered from 3V3\nJoystick (powered from 3V3, NOT 5V): X = GPIO10 (ADC1_CH9), Y = GPIO9 (ADC1_CH8), SW = GPIO8 (INPUT_PULLUP)\nAmp I2S: LRC = GPIO3, BCLK = GPIO2, DIN = GPIO1, VIN = 5V\nButtons (INPUT_PULLUP, pressed = LOW): UP = 7, RIGHT = 6, LEFT = 5, DOWN = 4\nOnboard RGB LED: GPIO48. Native USB (CDC) for Serial. Free: TX/RX (43/44), GPIO13" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1eba11b8-67db-464e-be8c-2fcc58e12822"))
